graph TD
    A[glibc malloc] --> B[ptmalloc2 allocator]
    B --> C{Allocation Strategy}
    
    C -->|Small < 512 bytes| D[Fast Bins]
    C -->|Medium < 128KB| E[Small/Large Bins]
    C -->|Huge >= 128KB| F[mmap direct]
    
    D --> D1[LIFO single-linked list]
    D --> D2[No coalescing]
    D --> D3[Very fast]
    
    E --> E1[Doubly-linked lists]
    E --> E2[Sorted by size]
    E --> E3[Coalescing enabled]
    E --> E4[Best-fit or first-fit]
    
    F --> F1[Direct kernel allocation]
    F --> F2[Separate from main heap]
    F --> F3[Immediately returned to OS on free]
    
    G[Arenas] --> G1[Per-thread heaps]
    G --> G2[Reduce contention]
    G --> G3[Up to 8*cores on 64-bit]
    
    B -.-> G
    
    style D fill:#e8f5e8
    style E fill:#fff4e1
    style F fill:#e1f5ff
    style G fill:#ffe6f0
